  "query_preview": "..\nA mostly dry trade-wind pattern is expected through Thursday, as the\nridge from previous days begins to exit to the west following distant\nSTY Champi. After, a trade-wind trough coming in from the east-\nnortheast is expected to move in, bringing low-end patchy showers\nand some thunderstorms enhanced by the pinching between the subtropical\nridge to the north, and building tropical disturbances to the\nsoutheast. A return of another tropical ridge spanning from Palau is\nlikely during the weekend, bringing another period of drier\nconditions beginning Sunday.",
